# BFCM 2025 recap (shared in #growth, 3 Dec 2025)

- Net sales over the four days: **$237,718**, up **209%** on the week before.
- 3,583 orders, 1,072 new customers acquired.
- Conversion rate 4.1% vs 2.6% normal. Average gross basket $88 vs $72.
- At our 60% margin that is roughly $78,408 profit after the extra $18,000 of paid social.
- New customers will pay back many times over: our customers are worth ~$210 each over their lifetime.
- Proposal for 2026: same mechanics, 30% off, start the early-access emails two weeks out.
